    <body>
      <div type="codex">
        <pb n="1" facs="#f01" />
        <div n="1" type="scan" subtype="binding">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="copy-annotation">
              <label>封面展覽標籤</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">CENTENNIAL EXHIBITION.／China Protestant Mission.／No 114</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="copy-annotation">
              <label>封面墨筆</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">636 j</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="copy-annotation">
              <label>封面鉛筆</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">Sinica 1640／Ser. d. 716／Chin. 636 j</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：封面展覽標籤的「114」為手寫，中央墨筆「636 j」與下方鉛筆舊號相合。紅綠線裝另記。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="2" facs="#f02" />
        <div n="2" type="scan" subtype="binding">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f02-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">轉禍為福之法</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-imprint">
              <label>題葉右欄紀年</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="black">道光十八年戊戌鐫</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-imprint">
              <label>題葉左欄刊記</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="black">新嘉波堅夏書院藏板</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：正封裏無印刷正文。左面：黃色題葉有三個印欄，中央大字題名，右小字紀年，左小字刊記。刊記依原刻作「新嘉波」。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="3" facs="#f03" />
        <div n="3" type="scan" subtype="binding">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f03-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">　　轉禍為福之法</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f03-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">天光晴朗、惠風和暢、吾出散步。忽遇兩個人、一個年紀老邁、姓</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f03-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">德、名齡、一個少年姓王名會汾。兩者高談濶論、對答如流。余聆</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f03-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">一半晌、那輕年的說道、久違顏範、未得一奉台教、茅塞滿腔。敢</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f03-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">問老先生、素日說贖罪之理、慰世人如何。晚生聽見老台勸陸</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f03-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">宗兄、云、死在旦夕之時、宜固執贖罪之道。他也、聽從。雖病勢危</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f03-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">篤、心腸酷裂、却是無任欣慰、就死也瞑目。德齡道先生所說來</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f03-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">不錯、所傳之道、所言之理、非擅自而立。然上帝自天啟示人類</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f03-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">云。萬人諸代皆獲罪于上帝、緣罪惡招上帝之義怒、見定罪、陷</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f03-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">地獄、得禍極酷、永遠折墮、乃上帝深切愛世。賜其獨生之子令</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f03-l-c10">
              <label>左側版心</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">轉禍為福之法／一</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：題葉反向透印未重錄。框下淡圓印文待核。左面：正文第1葉起。版中見短頓、實黑點與空圈，例如第2欄「暢」旁短頓與「步」旁實點、第3欄「流」旁空圈。TXT 的頓號與句號保留句讀位置。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:None">
              <quote>淡圈印文</quote>
              <note type="editorial">題葉背面框下可見淡圓形實物痕；印文難以辨定。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="4" facs="#f04" />
        <div n="4" type="scan" subtype="author-text">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f04-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">凡信之者免陷沉淪。乃得常生也。且上帝遣子降世、不罪世人</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f04-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">乃救世人也。凡信之者無定罪、但凡不信者已見定罪、因不肯</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f04-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">信、上帝獨生之子也。此之謂也。且說、王會汾細聽問道、那個信</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f04-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">若何、晚生也、信神明尊大、無比無似、至清、至淨、莫非信德乎。德</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f04-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">吃一驚說道。終不是、先生所信之神明、為假無實、這信者莫說</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f04-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">無益、就是極惡重罪。聖書曰。上帝乃靈、而凡拜之者、必以靈意、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f04-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">誠心而拜之也。此乃自然之理。至于信耶穌者、最緊要之事。救</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f04-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">主垂愛世人、替世之罪捐命、甚願贖人之罪、被釘十字架死了。</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f04-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">恁般的仁愛、有海一般深、有山一般高、無限無量。倘我受仁愛、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f04-r-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">沾其慈悲、又知是德洋恩溥涵浹羣生、隨捫心自問、查究本罪</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f04-r-c10">
              <label>右側版心</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">轉禍為福之法／一</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f04-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">痛悔前非。遂想云、因吾自取咎矣、其罪彌天亘地、不可勝。故上</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f04-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">帝之子遭。千苦受萬難焉。吾向來深荷厚恩、日流惡、而莫悔矣、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f04-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">豈非嚴哉。上帝之子愛我、而吾不答愛。上帝之子憐我、而吾輕</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f04-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">憐、眞可謂疎慢之愆、擢髮難數。緣此深注念、羞愧妄行。因罪惡</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f04-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">掩面揮涕、心痛膽裂矣。便伏拜救主耶穌、認罪、露過、明說。吾永</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f04-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">墮地獄、為堪當之刑。乃上帝之子、無不深加體恤、切祈施恩、萬</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f04-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">惜千憐焉。然信服耶穌、故依焉、全靠焉、且知因救主、代我之罪</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f04-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">遭苦、故我獲罪之救、這可謂信德矣。王會汾道、我看世人各有</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f04-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">所圖。却守信德的人鮮矣。晚生也一聞先生的言、未曉得如何。</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f04-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">他道。惟聖神有能開人之心、教之曉得道理也。吾殉于貨色貪</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f04-l-c10">
              <label>左側版心</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">轉禍為福之法／二</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：正文第1葉背。末欄「涵浹」為候讀。左面：正文第2葉起，原刻頓點依所見轉寫。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:10">
              <quote>涵浹</quote>
              <note type="editorial">末欄兩字部分墨色偏淡，保留初錄候讀。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="5" facs="#f05" />
        <div n="5" type="scan" subtype="author-text">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f05-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">戀紅塵、而縱俄頃之歡、故此未通得信德之情。倘老先生要進</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f05-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之、只求聖神教化惡心、遂仰耶穌之恩、賴救主之功、求呼籲上</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f05-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">帝、常行不斷焉。他道、耶穌接罪人、曷可知乎。曰、救主親口云。爾</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f05-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">苦勞負重者、俱來就我、吾卽賜安也。吾乃溫良謙遜、故受我之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f05-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">托、學我之道。則爾心可享安慰。因我托人之事乃易、我付人之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f05-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">負乃輕也。由是觀之、耶穌招汝火速而來也。他道、由何可知耶</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f05-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">穌救人之罪耶。曰、聖書云、因萬人犯罪、缺上帝之榮、乃因耶穌</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f05-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">基督贖之功、白白受恩表義也。夫上帝立耶穌贖罪之祭、使人</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f05-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">信倚其流血之功、可昭彰其義。然恕先世之罪、上帝寬貸今世、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f05-r-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">亦彰其公義。卽自為公義、亦以信耶穌者為義矣。又曰、上帝救</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f05-r-c10">
              <label>右側版心</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">轉禍為福之法／二</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f05-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">我出黑暗之權、搬我入其愛子之國、賴其流血吾得贖罪、並獲</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f05-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">諸過之救。耶穌乃無現上帝之像、萬物之初生。蓋天地有形無</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f05-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">形之物、皆賴其子造化。亦國位、主宰、管轄、權勢、皆賴上帝之子</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f05-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">造化、都為其榮而在焉。且上帝之之子、在萬物之先、又萬物賴</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f05-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之得立焉。他道、旣是如此、余伐功、莫非得救乎、晚生不說謊、不</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f05-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">騙人、不偷物、不淫邪、常時公道、與人往來、施恩行德、恁般善行、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f05-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">莫非足致救魂乎、何用救主耶。曰、上帝之律例明焉、上主立法</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f05-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">以彰威體。但世間無一人守天之法也、諸凡犯罪于上帝、自招</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f05-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">刑罰。是以先生也、為罪人也。故此人之力不足自救。上帝遣其</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f05-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">獨子、藉肉身之罪容、而緣我罪、在其肉體刑罰惡。旣然子女共</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f05-l-c10">
              <label>左側版心</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">轉禍為福之法／三</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：第2葉背，首欄「俄頃」保留。左面：第3葉起。第4欄「上帝之之子」原刊二「之」連印。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:2">
              <quote>呼籲</quote>
              <note type="editorial">籲字下部近版框且筆畫稠密，保留候讀。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="6" facs="#f06" />
        <div n="6" type="scan" subtype="author-text">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f06-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">一骨肉、主亦像似共之、且捐命致死、可敗壞主治死者魔鬼也。</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f06-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">請先生深思耶穌之外、總無他人可倚之、以得救也。且說、王會</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f06-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">汾暗想道、我學生趨吉避禍、殊覺不易。凡事不可著力處、便是</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f06-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">上帝矣。吾賴上帝之眷祐、避此世之艱難、屢蒙覆幄之恩焉。只</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f06-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">可恨每日人死、未知往何處。我也必死、而落陰間焉。旣是如此、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f06-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">避後死之難、我所甚願、倘贖罪之理、有把柄、則永賴洪麻、而保</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f06-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">全焉。但不知實情、坐又不安、立又不寧也。正猜測間、德齡道、先</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f06-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">生只仰觀太陽、莫非普照天下乎、尙可疑乎。然則耶穌乃我的</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f06-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">救主、照明顯著亦然、証指供確矣、稍無疑矣。定實確當之事、曷</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f06-r-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">翻疑哉。上帝表彰其子耶穌、行神蹟靈異、徵諸庶民。耶穌三日</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f06-r-c10">
              <label>右側版心</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">轉禍為福之法／三</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f06-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">後復活、明著自為上帝之子也。故曰、我是生活、昔死今活于世</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f06-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">世誠哉。此言也。我執陰間生死之鑰也。吾兄宜信聖書之言、沒</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f06-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">世不忘也。實在耶穌基督為眞證、自死初生者、普天下萬王之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f06-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">皇者。其本愛我、親流己血、洗滌我罪、封我為王、祭主奉事神父</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f06-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">上帝者、煌榮權勢歸之世世靡暨。正心所願也。</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f06-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">且說。余耳上耳下細聽此敘談、自想、所關甚要、莫不必銘五內。</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f06-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">正思想間、風雨驟至、黑氣漫天。我三人淋得遍身透濕矣。頃間</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f06-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">躲身、環遶而視、就是我看汝、汝望我。半晌默無語、我就開口道。</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f06-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">賢兄適纔論救靈魂之理、小弟才疎智淺、沒有學問、請實告我、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f06-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">男女老幼、尊卑善惡、一槪可得救乎。德齡道、上帝弗偏視人類、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f06-l-c10">
              <label>左側版心</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">轉禍為福之法／四</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：第3葉背，第6欄依原刊作「洪麻」。第9欄「証指供確」字形未定。左面：正文第4葉起，第5欄短收，留原欄空位。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:9">
              <quote>証指供確</quote>
              <note type="editorial">四字可辨程度不一，仍採初稿候讀待字書佐證。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="7" facs="#f07" />
        <div n="7" type="scan" subtype="author-text">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f07-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">皆獲罪于天而見定罪。今上帝白白施恩。因耶穌代罪人被釘</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f07-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">十字架受死、頒下寬貸赦罪矣、此之謂矣。余道、旣是如此、然盜</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f07-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">賊兇手亦得罪之赦乎。曰、設使痛悔前非、改惡遷善、上帝因耶</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f07-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">穌之大功、寬宥開恩、免其懲辦。余道、莫非沾耶穌之恩、後仍舊</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f07-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">罹重愆否。他曰、聖書云、爾自忖度如死、以滅罪惡。但今復活、以</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f07-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">事上帝、賴耶穌基督之祐也。故勿容罪主爾劣體、致縱私慾、又</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f07-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">勿、以四肢為行惡之器、以縱罪矣。乃如死而復活之人、捨己、奉</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f07-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">上帝務以四肢為行善之器、以事上帝矣。勿容罪惡作主、因爾</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f07-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">弗賴律法、乃沾恩典也。余吃一驚道。人懷毒心、卽沾救主之恩、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f07-r-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">怎何瞬眼間、回心向道改過自新乎。他道、耶穌賜聖神賦心、教</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f07-r-c10">
              <label>右側版心</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">轉禍為福之法／四</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f07-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">人悔悟力追、勉勵向善、令人行仁義忠信、樂善不倦矣。夫聖神</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f07-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之化世人、猶風靡草。東風則草靡而西、西風則草靡而東。在風</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f07-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">所由、而草為之靡矣。故曰、聖神感化世人成全焉。耶穌之信士</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f07-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">應該遵德、樂義、勉勵精修、守潔備虔焉。故此聖書曰、爾旣順良</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f07-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之子、則勿仍舊盲昧、任從私慾也。但所召爾者、旣為清潔、則汝</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f07-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">諸品行、亦當清潔矣。經云。吾旣潔清、爾亦潔清矣。又曰、夫上帝</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f07-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">以神德賜我生命、虔孝、可認召我修德、望榮者、因此上帝應承</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f07-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">最大寶貝之福、使爾脫離世上之惡慾、共通神性也。是以該當</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f07-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">勉勵信、信加諸德、德加諸智、智加諸貞、貞加諸耐、耐加諸虔、虔</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f07-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">加諸仁、仁加諸愛。若有德盛裕、則在耶穌基督之道、汝可無疎</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f07-l-c10">
              <label>左側版心</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">轉禍為福之法／五</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：第4葉背，第6欄「劣體」為候讀。左面：正文第5葉起，同欄兩現「草靡」。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:6">
              <quote>劣體</quote>
              <note type="editorial">劣字構件看似少、力，仍留候讀及位置。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="8" facs="#f08" />
        <div n="8" type="scan" subtype="author-text">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f08-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">無荒矣、但未有此德者、則盲眼昧心、不知淨去舊罪也。是故兄</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f08-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">弟最當勤心表明、誠為上帝所召選之人、蓋如此行者永不廢</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f08-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">也。如此可大進吾主耶穌基督之永存之國也。且說、余聞這言、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f08-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">悅然信服、切求耶穌垂顧、照應、賜聖神焉。那個王會汾也無任</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f08-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">欣慰矣。我三人知此理、故福安暨合潭。兹生賴救主、後生仰望</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f08-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">耶穌之眷祐、享天堂之福矣。</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f08-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">看官留心信耶穌之道矣、汝願避禍進福、竭力盡忠、猛發信心</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f08-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">矣。便轉禍為福也。</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f08-r-c08">
              <label>右側版心</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">轉禍為福之法／五</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：第5葉背為正文末面。第6欄與第8欄短收，第7欄「看官」從版框頂重起。第8欄「矣」旁見實點，「也」旁見空心圈。左面：正文後的空白面。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="9" facs="#f09" />
        <div n="9" type="scan" subtype="author-text">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：冊尾空白，未見文字。 左面：後封裏空白，未見文字。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="10" facs="#f10" />
        <div n="10" type="scan" subtype="author-text">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：後封無成句文字，有局部殘墨與污痕。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
